WEBVTT

00:31:28.337 --> 00:31:30.597
second surges.

00:31:30.621 --> 00:31:33.055
So is that the right way
to think about it?

00:31:33.079 --> 00:31:35.710
There's a scenario where,
until this happens,

00:31:35.734 --> 00:31:36.920
and if it's 18 months,

00:31:36.944 --> 00:31:40.321
that's an incredibly long time
for the world to be

00:31:40.345 --> 00:31:43.502
in that sort of dangerous, scary dance.

00:31:44.480 --> 00:31:48.784
SB: Well, I think the issue here is that
is a little bit the way to think of it,

00:31:48.808 --> 00:31:50.523
but the experiment is going on now.

00:31:50.547 --> 00:31:55.503
China is now releasing its controls,
and we will see what happens there.

00:31:55.527 --> 00:31:57.698
We'll see where they have
to clamp back down

00:31:57.722 --> 00:31:59.168
and what's going to happen,

00:31:59.192 --> 00:32:01.404
and we'll get a good idea
of what that's like.